  "details": "1. Receive a boop from a friend\n\n2. Check the notification from VRChat Home\n\n3. Notice the two icons are indistinguishable and only the first one may have a tooltip\n\nThe second one is named \"View [user]'s profile\", but on Microsoft Edge 149.0.4022.69 the hyperlink takes priority for focus and the tooltip's not shown as alt text on hover.\n\nExpected result: Use eye icon for the profile link, two different tooltips.\n\nActual result: Two checkmarks, only one has a working tooltip.",
